Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:36.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(1985年10月26日星期六)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:50.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要去兜风?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a ride, mister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:57.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天呀 看到你实在太好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man, are you a sight for sore eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:59.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:02.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你表现得好像 我们一个礼拜没见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're acting like you haven't seen me in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:04.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:07.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧 没什么事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay? Is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:13.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:16.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:33.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你一定要跟我回去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! You've got to come back with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.63,0:01:36.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:37.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:44.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 你在干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. What are you doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要燃料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(熔解先生：家用能源反应器)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 快上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Quick! Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我才刚回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Look, Doc, I just got here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和詹妮弗要开新车去兜风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer's here. We're gonna take the new truck for a spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带她一起去 这件事也跟她有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bring her along. This concerns her, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:00.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 你在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, Doc. What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:02.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底未来发生了什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens to us in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:05.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们变成大混蛋了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, do we become assholes or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你们 你们都很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. You and Jennifer both turn out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你们的小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your kids, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:11.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的小孩需要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something has got to be done about your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:21.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最好退后一点 马路太短 我们没办法加速到88英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, we better back up. We don't have enough road to get up to 88.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:26.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马路? 我们去的地方不需要马路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roads? Where we're going, we don't need roads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.85,0:02:31.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我那间汽车保养厂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! Marty, I wanted to show you these new matchbooks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火柴盒已经印好了 你来看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my auto detailing I had printed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:39.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一部会飞的迪罗里安车?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A flying DeLorean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《回到未来2》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:30.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出租车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxicab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么出租车 我们不是在飞吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean a "taxicab"? I thought we were flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:35.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Doc. What's going on, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底在何时、何地?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we? When are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在正朝 加州山谷镇方向前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're descending toward Hill Valley, California,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:48.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间是2015年10月21日 星期三的下午4点29分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at 4:29 p.m. On Wednesday, October 21, 2015.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:50.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2015年?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2015?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道说我们来到了未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean we're in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来? 马丁 什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Future. Marty, what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎能来到未来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we be in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:03.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么解释 反正...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to tell you this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在坐在时光机中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you're in a time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是2015年?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is the year 2015?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2015年10月21日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}October 21, 2015.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, so, like, you weren't kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:16.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能看到自己的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, we can actually see our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你说我们结婚了 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, now, you said we were married, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:22.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼盛大吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Was it a big wedding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:24.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我们能看到自己的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, we're gonna be able to see our wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇! 我会看到自己的礼服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. I'm gonna be able to see my wedding dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们住在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I wonder where we live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是大房子 还有很多小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet it's a big house with lots of kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多少孩子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many kids...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:33.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你在做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:35.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是安眠感应器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a sleep-inducing alpha rhythm generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:38.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她问太多问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was asking too many questions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人们对未来不能知道太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no one should know too much about their future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来 当她醒来时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way when she wakes up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只觉得是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she'll think it was all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那干嘛把她带来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what did you bring her for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是迫于无奈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:50.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时她看到 不该看到的时光机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She saw the time machine. I couldn't just leave her there with that information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:52.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 我的计划中她不是主角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. She's not essential to my plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:55.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 听你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're the doc, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是出口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's our exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(哥帝三世 山谷市市长欢迎您们)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(这里是居住的好地区)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:28.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 你先出去换衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you've gotta get out and change clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:30.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在? 雨那么大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now? It's pouring rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:35.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再等五秒钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait five more seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:44.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on the tick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:48.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing. Absolutely amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:52.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜邮局就没有 气象局这么有效率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad the post office isn't as efficient as the weather service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:54.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(熔解工业)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怕你认不出我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse the disguise, Marty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以伪装了一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was afraid you wouldn't recognize me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到回春诊所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to a rejuvenation clinic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大修门面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and got an all-natural overhaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们除皱、植发、换血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took out some wrinkles, did a hair repair, changed the blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:12.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我能再多活三、四十年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}added a good 30 or 40 years to my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外还换了脾脏和结肠 你看如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They also replaced my spleen and colon. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:20.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来年轻很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:24.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:27.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,令人难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去逛逛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta check this out, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in good time, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在时间紧迫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on a tight schedule here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我的未来应该很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about my future. I mean, I know I make it big.{\r}
