Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到80年代咖啡店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Cafe '80s,{\r}
