Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:26.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的特餐是烤豆寿司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our special today is mesquite-grilled sushi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:28.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要试人质特餐 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have the hostage special! Cajun style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:30.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要试人质特餐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have the hostage special!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:33.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要试人质特餐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have the hostage special!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, guys! Hey, hey, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要瓶百事可乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is a Pepsi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我常看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I've seen you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是老马丁的儿子 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Marty McFly's kid, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:54.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是小马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Marty Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不容易呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough break, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:01.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和那个混蛋同名一定很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be rough being named after a complete butthead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:04.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂! 有人在家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello? Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:07.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你猪脑啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think, McFly, think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:10.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你老爸是个笑柄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your old man? Mr. Loser?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:11.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是一个大笑柄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loser with a capital "L."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道乔治不是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I happen to know George McFly is no longer a loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:20.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在说乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not talking about George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:22.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about his kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:26.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是你的老爸 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your old man, Marty McFly Sr.,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他潦倒一辈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the man who took his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天天冲厕所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and flushed it completely down the toilet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:33.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 他有吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean... I mean, he did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:38.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gramps,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:42.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你要打两层蜡 不是一层!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you two coats of wax on my car, not just one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:45.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上个礼拜我才打过第二层蜡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, I just put the second coat on last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是闭着眼睛打吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? With your eyes closed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩是亲戚吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you two related?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:52.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂! 有人在家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello? Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你脑袋到哪儿去了 格里夫刚刚 不是叫我"爷爷"吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Griff just calls me "Grandpa" for his health?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:56.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他就是格里夫? - 爷爷 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's Griff? - Gramps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不懂为什么要付你钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell am I paying you for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 替我向你奶奶问好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid, say hello to your grandma for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out here, Gramps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你别急嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, take it easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:11.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你等着 哪儿都别去 下一个就是你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, McFly, don't go anywhere! You're next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是电动游戏机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a video game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(西部枪手)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我把它修好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸教过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad taught me about these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:23.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是西部枪手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Wild Gunman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么玩这个游戏?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you play this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:27.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我露两手给你们看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:30.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是一流的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a crack shot at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:35.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(射击顶呱呱)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,居然要用手去玩?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean you have to use your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简直是婴儿的玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like a baby's toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婴儿玩具?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby's toy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,百事可乐 太好了 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepsi Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 糟糕 - 百事可乐 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn - Pepsi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是叫你在里面等我吗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I told you to stay in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:05.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格里夫 你们好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Griff. Guys, how's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麦佛莱 - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- McFly! - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麦佛莱 - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- McFly! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的鞋带松了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your shoe's unvelked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:23.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚的事你决定了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, McFly, have you made a decision about tonight's opportunity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:25.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格里夫 我实在不能确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Griff. You know, I was thinking about it. I'm not sure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I just think, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事好像有点危险...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it might be a little bit dangerous, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:31.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱 你怎么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有阴囊吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got no scrote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他简直无能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a complete wimp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:44.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底决定了没有? 要不要参加?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it gonna be, McFly? Are you in or out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不能确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just... I'm not sure that I should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想和我爸爸商量一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, because I think that I should discuss it with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸? 你爸爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father? Your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答错了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong answer, McFly! You lose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我参加 不管你说什么我都会做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Griff, I'll do it. I'll do it, buddy. Whatever you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待在这里别出声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down and shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩继续骑 不准停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep pedaling, you two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 让我听听正确的答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's hear the right answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:27.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候变狠啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when did you become the physical type?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答案是"不"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer's no, Griff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"不"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:31.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你是聋了还是听不懂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What are you, deaf and stupid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说"不"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦? 胆小鬼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, McFly? Chicken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you call me, Griff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:47.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胆小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chicken, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:50.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人敢叫我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody calls me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 来呀 - 你们看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, punk! - Hey, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey. Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 小女孩!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Little girl, little girl. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:27.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Look,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想向你借盘旋板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to borrow your Hoverboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:33.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在盘旋板上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on a Hoverboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿出盘旋板!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the boards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去抓马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去抓他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那里! 我们赶上他了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Yeah, we got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都那么熟悉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something very familiar about all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你这个笨蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly, you bojo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,板子不能在水上走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those boards don't work on water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你有动力!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you've got power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:27.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钩起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hook on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(比特斗牛犬)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始作战!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batter up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:15.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一群笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buttheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:18.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(法院大楼)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:31.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"干燥程式开始"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drying mode on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"烘干夹克"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacket drying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:37.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"你的夹克已干"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your jacket is now dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:43.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 小女孩 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid. Hey, little girl, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你留着 我有比特斗牛犬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it. I got a Pit Bull now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:46.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:48.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救钟塔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save the clock tower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,捐点钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid. Throw in 100 bucks, will you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:52.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来拯救钟塔吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and help save the clock tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我...对不起 不行 - 帮帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry, no. - Come on, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:55.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是历史上重要的里程碑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an important historical landmark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:57.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, some other time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在六十年前被闪电击中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lightning struck that thing 60 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,芝加哥小熊队得到世界冠军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Cubs win World Series.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:06.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胜过迈阿密队?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against Miami?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 太出人意料了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's something, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:10.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁料得到? 这是一百比一呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would've thought? 100-1 shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望能回到过去开赛前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could go back to the beginning of the season,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好在小熊队身上下注{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put some money on the Cubs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:16.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说迈阿密...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just meant that Miami...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:18.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:21.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说真希望能回到过去开赛前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I wish I could go back to the beginning of the season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好在小熊队身上下注!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put some money on the Cubbies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:31.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书很有意思 外面还有封套(1950-2000运动年鉴){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this has an interesting feature. It has a dust jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:33.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,作用是保护书本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Books used to have these to protect the covers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:35.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这当然是在防尘纸发明以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, that was before they had dust-repellent paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:37.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你喜欢灰尘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you're interested in dust,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:40.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有古雅的 1980年代的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a quaint little piece from the 1980s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸尘器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called a DustBuster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要发大财了 - 马丁!  在上面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't lose. - Marty! Marty! Up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:51.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 怎么样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:53.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你等着 我会停到你那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by. I'll park over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:22:59.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间正好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, right on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行的迪罗里安车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flying DeLorean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:04.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有三十年没见过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen one of those in 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:06.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Excuse me. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 开车看路行不行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm walking here! I'm walking here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:12.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:16.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要开车就别吃镇定剂 讨厌!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't drive, trank, low-res scuzzball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:18.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有两个他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:21.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让他不省人事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left him in a suspended animation kennel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:22.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就连爱因斯坦也搞不清状况!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein never knew I was gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:28.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 这里到底发生了什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! What in the name of Sir Isaac H. Newton happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:31.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子出现 搞得乱七八糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, Doc, listen, my kid showed up. All hell broke loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:37.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕! 是安眠感应器 我好怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott, the sleep inducer. I was afraid of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为先用在詹妮弗身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I used it on Jennifer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:39.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以剩下来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there wasn't enough power left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:42.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不够让你儿子睡足一个钟头 糟糕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to knock your son out for a full hour. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:44.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, Doc, Doc, look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's changing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(青年小马丁因偷窃被捕)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.15,0:23:52.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(阿飞党被拘留  盘旋板冲撞毁坏法院大楼)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:00.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是被人陷害的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was framed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:04.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 这就对了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes, of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:07.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由于盘旋板事件的发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because this Hoverboard incident has now occurred,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格里夫进了监牢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Griff now goes to jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.53,0:24:11.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子就不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, your son won't go with him tonight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和他去偷东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that robbery will never take place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:15.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来 未来的历史...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus, history, future history,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.03,0:24:18.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被改写了 这就是证明!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has now been altered, and this is the proof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.49,0:24:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了 虽然和我计划不同 管他的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, we've succeeded, not exactly as I planned, but no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:23.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们去找詹妮弗然后回家!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go get Jennifer and go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:27.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Einie. Hi, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.00,0:24:30.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:31.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纪念品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a souvenir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"五十年的运动统计资料"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"50 years of sports statistics."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:36.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有娱乐性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly recreational reading material, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:37.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 把未来的资讯带回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hey, Doc, what's the harm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:39.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in bringing back a little info on the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定还能赌上几把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, maybe we could place a couple bets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我发明时光机不是为了赚钱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I didn't invent the time machine for financial gain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.73,0:24:48.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是为了能够更透彻的观察人性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The intent here is to gain a clearer perception of humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:49.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的所做、所为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we've been, where we're going,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,陷阱与可能性、危险与圈套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the pitfalls and the possibilities, the perils and the promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至希望能找到探讨宇宙"为什么"的答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps even an answer to that universal question, "Why?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我完全同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, I'm all for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.91,0:25:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但顺便赚点钱有什么不好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with making a few bucks on the side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:05.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把它丢到垃圾桶去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going to put this in the trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.92,0:25:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:16.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗住在山谷市 橡树街3793号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFly, Jennifer Jane Parker, 3793 Oakhurst Street,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:17.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四十七岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilldale, age 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:20.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四十七岁? 整容整得太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty-seven? That's a hell of a good face-lift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:21.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are they doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.97,0:25:23.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们用指纹核对她的身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used her thumbprint to assess her ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:25.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然指纹不变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since her thumbprint never changes over the years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.73,0:25:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们就把她当成未来的詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they simply assume she's the Jennifer of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:29.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去阻止她们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we gotta stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.23,0:25:30.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么开口? 告诉她们我们在做时光旅行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna say? That we're time travelers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:32.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们会把我们抓起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd have us committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:34.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没前科 把她送回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's clean. That means we take her home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.78,0:25:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去山谷市?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home? To Hilldale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.11,0:25:38.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到那里天都黑了 只好如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lt'll be dark by the time we get out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:41.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们要把她送回你未来的家!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. They're taking her home to your future home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:42.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在她们之后到达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll arrive shortly thereafter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:44.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到她 就回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get her out of there and go back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:46.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我可以看到我住在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean I'm gonna see where I live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和我老了是什么样子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna see myself as an old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.96,0:25:51.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 那会引起...我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, Marty. That could result in... Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.55,0:25:54.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗一定会遇到 未来的自己!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer could conceivably encounter her future self!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:57.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后果可能会不可收拾!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The consequences of that could be disastrous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:25:58.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:00.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我预见两种可能性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I foresee two possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.35,0:26:02.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一 看到三十年后的自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, coming face to face with herself 30 years older{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.93,0:26:05.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会让她吓昏过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would put her into shock, and she'd simply pass out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.14,0:26:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是第二 会遭遇时间冲突{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or two, the encounter could create a time paradox,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:10.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而导致破坏时空的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the results of which could cause a chain reaction that would unravel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连锁反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the very fabric of the space-time continuum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:14.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进而摧毁整个宇宙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and destroy the entire universe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:16.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最坏的假设{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted, that's a worst-case scenario.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.53,0:26:18.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭也许是局部性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The destruction might, in fact, be very localized,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只限于我们自己的银河系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}limited to merely our own galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:23.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那叫我放心不少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's a relief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:30.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 希望我们能 在她找到自己之前找到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. I sure hope we find Jennifer before she finds herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.93,0:26:32.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(C25航线有偏移)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,航线堵塞了 要开很久才能到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skyway's jammed. It's gonna take us forever to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.71,0:26:37.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不准带它走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this stays here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:39.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我发明时光机 不是用来赌博的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't invent the time machine to win at gambling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.39,0:26:41.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是用它来穿梭时光岁月的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I invented a time machine to travel through time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.85,0:26:43.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我知道 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know. I know, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.07,0:26:57.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布朗博士居然发明了时光机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Doc Brown invented a time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.84,0:27:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(山谷警察)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:09.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(山谷市)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,山谷市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilldale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:30.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个镇定剂、流氓滋生的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing but a breeding ground for tranks, lobos and zipheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:32.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真该把这地方拆掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they ought to tear this whole place down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.65,0:27:36.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:39.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧? - 没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:41.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你体内有点镇定剂 但应该能够走路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a little tranked, but I think you can walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:43.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夫人 你应该重新调整程式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, you should reprogram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.57,0:27:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进门不开灯很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dangerous to enter without lights on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.58,0:27:46.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开灯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.62,0:27:47.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Now, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.79,0:27:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你休息一下就没问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take it easy and you'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:53.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将来要小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And be careful in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:55.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:58.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱太太 祝你有个愉快的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a nice day, Mrs. McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:05.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全天播出美丽的视野{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broadcasting beautiful views 24 hours a day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:07.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你正在收看风景频道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're tuned to the Scenery Channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.77,0:28:14.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(爱的礼拜堂)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:29.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我居然在爱的礼拜堂结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get married in the Chapel O Love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:32.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom? Mom, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:34.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶快离开这里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.31,0:28:51.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom? Mom, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.48,0:28:57.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandma Lorraine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:28:58.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:28:59.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 嗨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi! Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:00.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:02.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他背痛的毛病又犯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he threw his back out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷的甜心好不好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Granddad's little pumpkin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:06.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你是怎么搞的? 他是怎么搞的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you do that? How did he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:08.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打高尔夫球不小心弄到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, out on the golf course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.83,0:29:09.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸妈回来了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are your folks home yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:11.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我带比萨饼来请大家吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought pizza for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:12.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会吃嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, who's going to eat all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.83,0:29:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.08,0:29:15.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,交通真挤!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn this traffic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:17.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗通常是这时候到家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer, that is Old Jennifer, usually gets home around now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:19.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们没太迟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope we're not too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.51,0:29:24.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 怎么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What's the matter, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.84,0:29:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好像看到出租车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment, I thought I saw a taxi in my rear display.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.51,0:29:29.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,貌似在跟踪我们 天呀 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was following us. Weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.18,0:29:32.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这扇窗子怎么仍是破的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this window's still broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当修理工叫爸爸胆小鬼时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, when the scenescreen repairman called Daddy a chicken,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.85,0:29:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸就把他丢出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy threw him out of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.52,0:29:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在再也找不到人来修了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we can't get anybody to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:41.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看坏成这个样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look how worn out this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:45.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马琳 你爸爸最大的毛病就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's biggest problem, Marlene,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.53,0:29:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别人一叫他胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that he loses all self-control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:49.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就控制不住自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when someone calls him chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:51.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 我们听他说过多少次?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times have we heard it, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.37,0:29:53.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈 我不能让人以为我是胆小鬼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mom, I can't let them think I'm chicken."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.29,0:29:54.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"不能让人以为我是胆小鬼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Can't let them think I'm chicken."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.04,0:29:57.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点也没错!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. Well, you're right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.37,0:29:58.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三十年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 30 years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:00.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸为了证明他不是胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your father tried to prove he wasn't chicken,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:03.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果发生那次车祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he ended up in an automobile accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.26,0:30:04.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是和劳斯莱斯相撞那一次?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you mean with the Rolls-Royce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.97,0:30:07.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,车祸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Automobile accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.77,0:30:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦 我们去找詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Einie, let's find Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信 我住在山谷市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it. I live in Hilldale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.94,0:30:25.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 挺不错的嘛! - 走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is great! - Way to go, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.57,0:30:27.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你留在这里换衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, stay here. Just change clothes.{\r}
