Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:47.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我的错 是尼德的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! It wasn't my fault, sir. It was Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:48.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼德是幕后人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Needles was behind the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.60,0:35:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你和他合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you cooperated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:51.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 我没有 这是例行程序. - 这是违法的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I didn't. It was a sting operation. - It was illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.94,0:35:53.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在骗他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was setting him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.31,0:35:54.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看我的传真!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you knew. McFly, read my fax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.07,0:35:59.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你不要开除我 不要这样做 我被开除了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please, no. I cannot be fired. I'm fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.29,0:36:07.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(你被开除了)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.41,0:36:12.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这太严重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:16.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么对詹妮弗说?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I going to tell Jennifer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:18.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗 詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer. Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.42,0:36:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我真高兴看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Doc, am I glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.26,0:36:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从前门出去 我在那里等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out the front door. I'll meet you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.43,0:36:26.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有门把 门打不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't open. There's no doorknob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:29.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用拇指按金属板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press your thumb to the plate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.31,0:36:31.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么金属板?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What plate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.28,0:36:47.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个传真是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, what does this fax mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:50.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是公司开的玩笑 是一种玩笑传真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mom, it's a joke, an office joke. Kind of a joke fax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:51.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我听到你在叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I heard you yelling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:53.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 你别紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, Mom, Mom, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:56.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有叫 尼德和我在闹着玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't yelling. Needles and I were just kind of joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.21,0:36:57.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.42,0:36:58.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你失业了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, have you lost your job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:37:01.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,失业 妈 你想到那里去了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost my job, Mom? Get out of town. Look, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我这么年轻! - 我这么老! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm young! - I'm old!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.15,0:37:18.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.82,0:37:20.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 快来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, come quick! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:37.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她见到未来的自己后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She encountered her older self{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:40.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昏倒了 就如我所预测的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and went into shock, just as I predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.55,0:37:42.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.09,0:37:44.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快把她送回1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get her back to 1985,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:47.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就毁灭这部时光机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then I'm gonna destroy the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.22,0:37:48.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭它?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:50.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么去洞察人性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about that stuff about humanity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.18,0:37:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和找出"为什么"的解答?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we're going and why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.89,0:37:54.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冒的危险太大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The risks are just too great, as this incident proves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:55.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须负起这个责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was behaving responsibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.85,0:37:57.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can imagine the danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.23,0:37:59.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时光机落入坏人之手 的后果会怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the time machine were to fall into the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.53,0:38:04.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一的遗憾 是没法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only regret is that I'll never get a chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.95,0:38:07.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去我最喜欢的年代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to visit my favorite historical era,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.61,0:38:09.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,旧西部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Old West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但时光旅行实在太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But time traveling is just too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.24,0:38:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是专心研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better that I devote myself to studying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:19.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙中其他难解的迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the other great mystery of the universe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.50,0:38:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.71,0:38:28.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁、爱因斯坦 准备暂时时间转移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, Einie, brace yourselves for temporal displacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.77,0:38:40.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:45.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回去了没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:53.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.47,0:39:15.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先把她放在吊椅上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put her in the swing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.93,0:39:17.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我送你回家 等会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll take you home, and you can come back{\r}
