Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:21.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等她醒过来 天又这么晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she awakens here in her own house and it's dark,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就比较容易说服她 那是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should be able to convince her that it was all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.69,0:39:25.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我们就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. We're just gonna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把她留在门廊上?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leave her here on the porch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.53,0:39:30.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迷惘会帮你说服她 这是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The disorientation will help convince her that it was all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:32.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还会睡多久?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long do you think she's gonna be out?{\r}
