Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.16,0:39:40.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好把嗅盐带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better bring smelling salts back with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.96,0:39:42.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the doc, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:43.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 爱因斯坦 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Come on. Let's go, Einie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.17,0:39:48.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:52.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,窗上怎么会有铁条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember bars being on these windows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.15,0:39:56.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(里昂地产)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.69,0:40:11.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果要找我 我会在实验室里拆这玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need me, I'll be back at my lab dismantling this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.86,0:40:13.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:32.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey, wait. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.74,0:40:53.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在我房间干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing in my room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.53,0:40:54.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 强暴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Rape! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.70,0:40:55.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.{\r}
