Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:41:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他爬到我身上 - 没事的 我不是来找麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He jumped me! - Hey, it's okay. I don't want any trouble.{\r}
