Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.37,0:41:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个小混混 你麻烦大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got trouble now, you piece of trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:05.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找我女儿干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing in here with my daughter?{\r}
