Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.75,0:41:09.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是进错了房子 你这个混...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that right, you little son of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:10.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look, I made a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.01,0:41:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你是大错特错!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn right you made a mistake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.80,0:41:14.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宰了他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!{\r}
