Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:18.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跑呀! 有本事就跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. You keep running, sucker!{\r}
