Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.02,0:41:23.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们吓不了我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't gonna be terrorized!{\r}
