Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.62,0:42:28.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1985年?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1985?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.54,0:42:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.67,0:42:31.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把报纸放下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:38.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是偷报纸的小混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're the son of a bitch who's been stealing my newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.30,0:42:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史特兰老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Strickland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.22,0:42:42.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史特兰老师 是我 我是马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Strickland. It's me, sir. It's Marty.{\r}
