Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.49,0:48:32.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有珠宝和酒?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your jewelry and your liquor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.41,0:48:35.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁替你付美容整形费?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna pay for your cosmetic surgery, Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.66,0:48:39.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你要我弄得这么大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the one who wanted me to get these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.66,0:48:42.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要就还给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want them back, you can have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.50,0:48:44.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 你要是敢走出这扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Lorraine. You walk out that door,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.88,0:48:47.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不但不供你 也不供你那些孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I won't only cut off you. I'll cut off your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.67,0:48:49.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.80,0:48:50.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.84,0:48:52.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 我会取消{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First your daughter, Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:54.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你女儿琳达的信用卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll cancel all her credit cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:56.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让她自己去和银行交涉欠款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can settle her debts with the bank all by herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:48:59.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那白痴儿子大卫 我要撤回他的假释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your idiot son, Dave. I'll get his probation revoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.93,0:49:02.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as for Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.10,0:49:04.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你喜欢看到 他们三个和你弟弟乔伊一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe you'd like to have all three of your kids behind bars,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.02,0:49:07.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全都关到牢里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like your brother Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.19,0:49:09.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在监狱里来个全家大团圆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One big, happy, jailbird family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.61,0:49:16.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你赢 我留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Biff. You win. I'll stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.87,0:49:23.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于你 一小时内你最好消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for you, I'll be back up here in an hour, so you better not be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.09,0:49:37.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没错 是我错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was right, and I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.06,0:49:41.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.85,0:49:42.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.02,0:49:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能替他辩护?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're actually defending him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.81,0:49:47.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我自找的 他是我丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had it coming. He's my husband,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.36,0:49:49.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他照顾我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he takes care of all of us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.90,0:49:51.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该得到我们的尊敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he deserves our respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:52.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尊敬?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.65,0:49:57.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的丈夫! 他怎么会是你的丈夫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your husband! How could he be your husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.95,0:49:59.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会离开爸爸嫁给他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you leave Dad for him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.08,0:50:01.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离开爸爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.41,0:50:03.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, are you feeling all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.54,0:50:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I'm not feeling all right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.08,0:50:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不知道 这里发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand one damn thing that's going on around here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.71,0:50:11.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没人告诉我呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and why nobody can give me a simple, straight answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.84,0:50:14.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头一定被打得很厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they must have hit you over the head hard this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:17.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 我只想知道一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I just want to know one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.97,0:50:20.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的爸爸乔治在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my father? Where's George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.43,0:50:26.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治...你的爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, George, your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.10,0:50:29.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十二年来一直在同一个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is in the same place he's been for the past 12 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.61,0:50:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是橡园公墓内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oak Park Cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.04,0:50:52.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(永恒的记忆  乔治麦佛莱之墓)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.30,0:51:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:05.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能发生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! This can't be happening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.06,0:51:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1973年3月15日?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"March 15, 1973."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.40,0:51:12.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 天啊 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please, God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.02,0:51:16.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 上帝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please, God. Please, God, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.78,0:51:20.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.82,0:51:23.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.41,0:51:25.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕这一切都是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid it is happening, Marty. All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.33,0:51:27.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:28.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我知道你父亲的事时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I learned about your father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.96,0:51:30.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就猜你会到这里来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured you'd come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道他出了什么事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you know what happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.13,0:51:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道1973年3月15日发生什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what happened March 15, 1973?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.89,0:51:46.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Marty. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.52,0:51:48.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到图书馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to the public library{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.68,0:51:50.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想把事情弄清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to try to make sense out of all the madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.69,0:51:52.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,图书馆被封闭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place was boarded up, shut down,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.23,0:51:54.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只好闯进去借报纸看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I broke in and borrowed some newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.23,0:51:55.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.90,0:51:57.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些事怎么会发生的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, how can all this be happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.94,0:51:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们像生活在地狱里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like we're in hell or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.49,0:52:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 这里是山谷镇 不过地狱也不会差到哪里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's Hill Valley. Although, I can't imagine hell being much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.58,0:52:07.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Einie. I'm sorry, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.04,0:52:11.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实验室乱七八糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lab is an awful, awful, awful, awful mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.67,0:52:14.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 乖狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.75,0:52:17.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,显然的 时空已经大乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, the time continuum has been disrupted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.05,0:52:20.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由于两个时空的交替{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}creating this new temporal event sequence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.55,0:52:22.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而导致这种暂时的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}resulting in this alternate reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.38,0:52:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你说白一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}English, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.51,0:52:25.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我画给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, here, here. Let me illustrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.52,0:52:34.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假设这条线代表时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine that this line represents time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.73,0:52:39.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是现在1985年 这是未来 这是过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the present, 1985, the future and the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.28,0:52:44.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这一点之前 也就是过去的某个时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prior to this point in time, somewhere in the past,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.49,0:52:46.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间线被扭曲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the timeline skewed into this tangent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.03,0:52:50.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而创造出另一个1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}creating an alternate 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.12,0:52:53.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对你、我和爱因斯坦 这是个扭曲的时空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alternate to you, me and Einstein,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.42,0:52:57.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但对别人则是真实的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but reality for everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.76,0:53:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,认得这个吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.84,0:53:05.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是装运动年鉴的袋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the bag the sports book came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.97,0:53:08.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为收据还在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, because the receipt was still inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.93,0:53:12.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在时光机里找到的 另外还有这个东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found them in the time machine along with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.44,0:53:20.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是贝夫的拐杖头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the top of Biff's cane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.61,0:53:22.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指未来的老贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, Old Biff from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.28,0:53:24.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 如果它在时光机中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct. It was in the time machine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.32,0:53:28.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就表示贝夫 和年鉴也曾待在时光机里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because Biff was in the time machine with the sports almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.29,0:53:30.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:33.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我们在未来时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, while we were in the future,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.37,0:53:34.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫拿走年鉴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff got the sports book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.92,0:53:37.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,偷了时光机 回到过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stole the time machine, went back in time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.33,0:53:40.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把书给了自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gave the book to himself at some point in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.01,0:53:45.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 证明就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. It says right here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.26,0:53:47.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫在1958年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Biff made his first million{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.51,0:53:50.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赢得一百万元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}betting on a horse race in 1958.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.10,0:53:52.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他并不是运气好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't just lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.47,0:53:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为他有年鉴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew because he had all the race results in the sports almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:53:58.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是这样赚得全部的财富{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how he made his entire fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.65,0:54:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用放大镜看他的口袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at his pocket with a magnifying glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.45,0:54:05.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那本年鉴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.82,0:54:09.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 居然偷我的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch stole my idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.03,0:54:12.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定听我讲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have been listening when I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.29,0:54:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我错了 整件事都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my fault. The whole thing is my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假如当初不买那本书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I hadn't bought that damn book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:21.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事也不会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}none of this would have ever happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.30,0:54:22.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事情已经过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's all in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.50,0:54:23.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是未来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.67,0:54:26.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 它证明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever. It demonstrates precisely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.63,0:54:28.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时光机误用的可怕后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how time travel can be misused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.51,0:54:31.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等把这些事情改正后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and why the time machine must be destroyed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.72,0:54:34.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把时光机毁掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after we straighten all of this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.18,0:54:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我们回到未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. So we go back to the future,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:38.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阻止贝夫偷时光机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we stop Biff from stealing the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.56,0:54:41.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 如果从这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't, because if we travel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.19,0:54:43.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出发去未来的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the future from this point in time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.73,0:54:47.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那会进入这个时空的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will be the future of this reality,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.07,0:54:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 贝夫是个贪污且有势力的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which Biff is corrupt and powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.33,0:54:53.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并和你妈妈结婚 而且...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and married to your mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.33,0:54:58.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这也发生在我身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in which this has happened to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.76,0:55:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(疯子发明家被判神精错乱)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.71,0:55:08.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若要改变现在必须回到过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Our only chance to repair the present is in the past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.68,0:55:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到时间线被扭曲之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the point where the timeline skewed into this tangent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.89,0:55:16.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了要恢复宇宙秩序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to put the universe back as we remember it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.06,0:55:19.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到真正的时空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get back to our reality,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.48,0:55:21.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须找到真正的日期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have to find out the exact date{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.40,0:55:23.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有特定的环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the specific circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.27,0:55:26.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在何时、何地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of how, where and when Young Biff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.19,0:55:28.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小贝夫如何拿到那本运动年鉴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got his hands on that sports almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.41,0:55:32.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去问他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.22,0:56:00.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,防弹衣! 天呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bulletproof vest! Great flick! Great frigging flick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.69,0:56:02.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙真聪明!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy is brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:04.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the hell's going...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到这里干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! What the hell are you doing in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.61,0:56:08.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 宴会结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Party's over, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.65,0:56:11.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐们 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会通过我的警卫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get past my security downstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.45,0:56:17.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事我想和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a little matter we need to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.24,0:56:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想要钱吗? 门都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Money, right? Well, forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.66,0:56:21.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是要钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.46,0:56:26.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"运动年鉴"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gray's Sports Almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.34,0:56:32.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听见他说的话了 小姐们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.80,0:56:34.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Party's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.47,0:56:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讲吧 你还知道些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start talking, kid. What else you know about that book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.68,0:56:43.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先告诉我你怎么拿到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you tell me how you got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.98,0:56:47.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在何时、何地、如何拿到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How, where and when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.65,0:56:51.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你坐下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.99,0:56:57.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.50,0:57:04.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间是1955年11月12日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}November 12, 1955. That was when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.37,0:57:07.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1955年11月12日 那是我回来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}November 12, 1955. That was the date I went back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.84,0:57:12.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那天正好是山谷镇 发生闪电暴风雨的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the date of the famous Hill Valley lightning storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:16.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对历史知道得不少 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know your history. Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远忘不了那个星期六{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never forget that Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.52,0:57:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从车行里把车开回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd just picked my car up from the shop,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我去参加赛车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I'd rolled it in a drag race a few days earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.56,0:57:27.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像是撞进粪肥车里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you crashed into a manure truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.57,0:57:31.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.24,0:57:33.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father told me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.11,0:57:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.61,0:57:37.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他死前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.58,0:57:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.29,0:57:44.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在做我自己的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there I was, minding my own business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.25,0:57:47.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个拄着拐杖的疯老头跑过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crazy old codger with a cane shows up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.63,0:57:49.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说是我的远亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says he's my distant relative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.71,0:57:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我们一点也不像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see any resemblance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.38,0:57:56.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他问我 你想发财吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he says, "How would you like to be rich?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.80,0:57:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I said, "Sure."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.43,0:58:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就把这本书给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he lays this book on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.56,0:58:07.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说这本书上有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says this book will tell me the outcome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.40,0:58:10.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本世纪所有运动比赛的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of every sporting event till the end of the century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.15,0:58:13.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要赌赢的那一方 就永远不会输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I have to do is bet on the winner, and I'll never lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.82,0:58:18.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我问 你的目的是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I said, "What's the catch?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.45,0:58:21.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说 我没有目的 但你一定要保密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says, "No catch. Just keep it a secret."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.62,0:58:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他就不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, he disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.25,0:58:29.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直没再看见他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never saw him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.31,0:58:44.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他另外还告诉我一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and he told me one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.60,0:58:47.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说 有一天一个疯狂科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "Someday a crazy, wild-eyed scientist,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.44,0:58:50.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是一个小孩可能会出现 问起这本书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"or a kid may show up asking about that book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.98,0:58:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"如果真的发生了..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And if that ever happens..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.28,0:59:01.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣 没想到会是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny. I never thought it would be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.53,0:59:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 你忘了一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, Biff, you're forgetting one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.33,0:59:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.96,0:59:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你死定了 混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're dead, you little son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.31,0:59:29.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.48,0:59:56.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(屋顶)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.73,1:00:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有种就跳呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, kid. Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.15,1:00:17.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自杀最好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A suicide will be nice and neat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.03,1:00:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不自杀呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.61,1:00:22.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就请你吃子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead poisoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.45,1:00:24.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不怕警察吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the police, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:26.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会根据子弹找出手枪来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna match up the bullet with that gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.95,1:00:29.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察归我管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, I own the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.04,1:00:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,况且他们至今仍找不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, they couldn't match up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.29,1:00:35.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀你父亲的凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bullet that killed your old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.84,1:00:37.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个狗养...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.67,1:00:42.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这就是因果报应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it's poetic justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.93,1:00:47.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个麦佛莱被同一支枪杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two McFlys with the same gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:00:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.41,1:01:05.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.62,1:01:12.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 门开得好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shot, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.67,1:01:15.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定不相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.42,1:01:17.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得回到1955年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go back to 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.34,1:01:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.60,1:01:32.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不错 是1955年11月12日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Doc. November 12, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.93,1:01:36.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个老贝夫怎么会选那一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable that Old Biff could've chosen that particular date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.61,1:01:37.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许表示那一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could mean that that point in time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.73,1:01:40.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,具有宇宙的重要性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inherently contains some sort of cosmic significance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.44,1:01:42.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是时空暂时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}almost as if it were the temporal junction point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:44.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汇聚点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the entire space-time continuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:47.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者那只是个巧合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the other hand, it could just be an amazing coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.83,1:01:50.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(1885年1月1日 目的地时间)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.37,1:01:53.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 我得记得修这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! Got to fix that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.12,1:01:54.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 时间设定完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Time circuits on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.54,1:01:57.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, time circuits on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.71,1:01:59.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就回去吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, we're not going back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:00.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.55,1:02:02.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗和爱因斯坦怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, what about Jennifer? What about Einstein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.38,1:02:03.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能把他们留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just leave them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.84,1:02:05.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 假设我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Marty. Assuming we succeed in our mission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.05,1:02:09.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个被改变的1985年 就会变回原来的1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this alternate 1985 will be changed back into the real 1985,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.64,1:02:12.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗和爱因斯坦 也就跟着转变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instantaneously transforming around Jennifer and Einie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.97,1:02:14.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer and Einie will be fine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.60,1:02:17.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且会忘掉这里的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they will have absolutely no memory of this horrible place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.48,1:02:18.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.48,1:02:21.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能成功呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we don't succeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.07,1:02:23.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.48,1:02:35.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(里昂地产 您明日的家)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪 我怎么觉得好像昨天才来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is heavy, Doc. I mean, it's like I was just here yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.50,1:02:43.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是昨天才来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were here yesterday, Marty. You were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.34,1:02:44.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想不到吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.67,1:02:47.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再过二十二分钟天就亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, sunrise should be in about 22 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.93,1:02:51.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你先进城 我来找小贝夫的行踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go into town. Track down Young Biff and tail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.30,1:02:53.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的某段时间 老贝夫会出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometime today, Old Biff will show up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.02,1:02:55.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把书给小贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to give Young Biff the almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.52,1:02:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能干预{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Above all you, must not interfere with that event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.69,1:03:00.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让老贝夫以为他成功 这样他才会离开1955年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must let Old Biff believe he's succeeded, so that he'll leave 1955{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.73,1:03:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并把迪罗里安开到未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bring the DeLorean back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.07,1:03:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.19,1:03:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等老贝夫一走 只要有机会就把年鉴拿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once Old Biff is gone, grab the almanac any way that you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.40,1:03:08.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住 我们的未来就靠这次行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, both of our futures depend on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.66,1:03:10.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用提醒我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to remind me of that, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.70,1:03:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是望远镜和无线电话机 保持联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's some binoculars and a walkie-talkie so we can keep in contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:18.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里修机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay here and try to repair the short in the time circuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:21.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不怕有人偷车了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way, we don't risk anyone else stealing the time machine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.38,1:03:25.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不会冒 碰到另一个自己的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I won't risk accidentally running into my other self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.76,1:03:26.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个自己?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other self?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.84,1:03:29.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 这里有两个我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. There are now two of me here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.09,1:03:30.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和两个你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there are two of you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.05,1:03:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个是1955年的布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other me is the Dr. Emmett Brown from 1955,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.22,1:03:40.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他帮另一个你回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the younger me that helps the other you get back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.94,1:03:42.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得电击钟塔吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember the lightning bolt at the clock tower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.65,1:03:44.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是今晚才发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That event doesn't happen until tonight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.73,1:03:47.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以千万小心不要碰到 另一个自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you must be very careful not to run into your other self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.40,1:03:48.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你身上得带点钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me give you some money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.68,1:03:50.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(紧急现金)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.41,1:03:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须准备好各种不同的钞票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to be prepared for all monetary possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.74,1:03:56.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去买件50年代的衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourself some '50s clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.08,1:03:58.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.92,1:04:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别太引人注目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something inconspicuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.00,1:04:05.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 这是马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc. Come in, Doc. This is Marty. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.75,1:04:07.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 你到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, Marty. This is Doc. Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.05,1:04:11.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我已到达这个地址{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Doc. I'm at the address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.64,1:04:12.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个添南家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only Tannen in the book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.93,1:04:14.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎不是贝夫的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't think this is Biff's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.01,1:04:16.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个老太太住在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like some old lady lives here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.97,1:04:18.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.14,1:04:21.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.19,1:04:23.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶 我去拿车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get my car, Grandma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.36,1:04:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候回来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.56,1:04:27.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你按摩我的脚指头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My feet hurt, and I want you to rub my toes some more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:29.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你这个老太婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, you old bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.19,1:04:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把球还给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us our ball back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.61,1:04:33.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么球? - 那个球!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What ball? - That ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.49,1:04:35.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What ball are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.62,1:04:37.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把球还给我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us our ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.37,1:04:39.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,球?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What ball? Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.33,1:04:41.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是你们的球吗 - 是的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this your ball? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.12,1:04:42.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们的球吗? 你们想要回去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it your ball? You want it back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.67,1:04:44.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.79,1:04:47.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去拿呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.84,1:04:55.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 那是贝夫的家 我正在跟踪他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, it is Biff's house. I'm on him. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.31,1:05:04.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.11,1:05:08.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:09.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全修好了 像崭新的一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Biff, she's all fixed up just like new,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.03,1:05:11.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法发动它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I couldn't get her started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.70,1:05:13.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你装了特别的装置吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some kind of kill switch on this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.61,1:05:15.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得知道按哪里才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you just gotta have the right touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.32,1:05:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我没人能发动这部车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody can start this car but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.20,1:05:19.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一共三百零二元五毛七{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the bill comes to $302.57.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:20.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三百块钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}300 bucks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.45,1:05:22.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才几处小刮痕就要修三百元?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}300 bucks for a couple of dents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.25,1:05:23.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, hey, that's bullshit, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.58,1:05:24.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Biff, it was horse shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.87,1:05:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,车里全是马粪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole car was full of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.08,1:05:28.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还付约翰八十块把它弄走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to pay Old Man Jones 80 bucks to haul it away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.21,1:05:29.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰可能把它卖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old Man Jones probably resold it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.63,1:05:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该给我卖粪的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I ought to get something for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.84,1:05:31.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want something for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.05,1:05:33.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话叫约翰给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go inside. You can call Old Man Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.93,1:05:34.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他肯给你的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he wants to give you a refund...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.05,1:05:36.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三百块!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 300 bucks, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.68,1:05:40.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我找到那小鬼 一定把他脖子扭断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I catch the guy that caused this, I'll break his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.68,1:05:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,粪肥 我记得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The manure. I remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.11,1:05:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四罐润滑油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four cans of Valvoline is fair, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.19,1:05:53.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三百块只送四罐?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four cans for a $300 job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.86,1:05:55.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的午餐钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't even have lunch in the shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.36,1:05:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该给我一箱润滑油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes me nauseous. I should get a case of oil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.70,1:05:58.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才肯给你300块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of you for a 300 buck job. You've been inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.62,1:06:00.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的大便车比厕所还难闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It smells worse than the bathroom at a gas station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.37,1:06:01.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又抢劫了我 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You robbed me again, Terry. Yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.75,1:06:03.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种味道永远不会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The smell's never gonna go away, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.58,1:06:04.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never gonna go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.71,1:06:06.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后一次帮你 谢啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I do you a favor. Last time. Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.71,1:06:09.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.88,1:06:15.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲 太美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's perfect, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.72,1:06:16.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look at it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会很漂亮!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to look so good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.43,1:06:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来会像...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.56,1:06:26.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在讲什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, lookey what we have here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.23,1:06:27.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,衣服真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, nice dress, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.40,1:06:29.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得 你什么都不穿会更好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, I think you'd look better wearing nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.90,1:06:32.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不去跳海?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff, why don't you take a long walk off a short pier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.86,1:06:33.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.99,1:06:35.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚学校有舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's that dance at school tonight, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.40,1:06:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的车修好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that my car's all fixed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.66,1:06:37.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你有机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure I'd cut you a break{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:39.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and give you the honor of going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.28,1:06:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和最英俊的我一起去参加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the best-looking guy in school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.78,1:06:41.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I'm busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.91,1:06:43.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 忙什么? - 忙着洗头发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, doing what? - Washing my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.58,1:06:46.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那和战舰装纱门一样好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's about as funny as a screen door on a battleship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.33,1:06:48.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 是潜艇装纱门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screen door on a submarine, you dork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.46,1:06:51.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经有人邀请我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Biff, somebody already asked me to the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.67,1:06:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁? 那个猪头乔治吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? That bug George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.46,1:06:57.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和卡尔文克莱一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going with Calvin Klein, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.22,1:06:58.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔文克莱? 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calvin Klein? No, it's not okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.55,1:07:01.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要和我一起去 懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going with me, understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.26,1:07:02.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的爪子拿开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your cooties off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.64,1:07:04.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候你才能想清楚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you gonna get it through your thick skull, Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.89,1:07:06.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.27,1:07:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你有一百万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff Tannen, I wouldn't be your girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.14,1:07:10.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不要你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if you had a million dollars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.44,1:07:16.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会的! 你我一定会在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you will! It's you and me, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.03,1:07:19.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.32,1:07:21.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是命中注定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.20,1:07:23.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天我会娶你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to marry you someday, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.45,1:07:25.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成我太太!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday you'll be my wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对女人永远有一套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always did have a way with women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.21,1:07:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老家伙 滚出我的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the hell out of my car, old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.29,1:07:34.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想娶她吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to marry that girl, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.84,1:07:36.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help make it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.30,1:07:38.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 寂寞芳心俱乐部吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Who are you, Miss Lonely-Hearts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.47,1:07:41.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get in the car, butthead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.34,1:07:43.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫谁笨蛋 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you calling butthead, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.47,1:07:45.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么弄的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know how to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.68,1:07:48.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我没人会发动我的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody can start this car but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.23,1:07:51.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快上车 今天算你走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get in the car, Tannen. Today's your lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.36,1:07:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老家伙 你小心开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey! Hey, watch where you're driving, old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.53,1:08:00.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刮到它 我就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you dent this car, I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.38,1:08:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.83,1:08:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才花了三百块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cost me 300 bucks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.71,1:08:10.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你别再念了 行不行?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you shut up about the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.21,1:08:13.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我住哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, and another thing. How do you know where I live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.21,1:08:15.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,算我们有亲戚关系吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say we're related, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.50,1:08:18.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正因为如此 我有个礼物给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that being the case, I got a little present for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.13,1:08:20.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会让你发大财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that'll make you rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.34,1:08:21.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想发财 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to be rich, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.43,1:08:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然 老迷糊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Sure. Right. That's rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.43,1:08:26.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你能让我发财吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to make me rich?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.89,1:08:30.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到这本书吗 这本书会告诉你未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this book? This book tells the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.19,1:08:32.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它告诉你 本世纪所有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tells the results of every major sports event{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.27,1:08:33.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,运动比赛的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till the end of the century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.56,1:08:37.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是足球、棒球 赛马、拳击赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Football, baseball, horse races, boxing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.65,1:08:42.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,里面的资料值千百万 我现在把它给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The information in here is worth millions, and I'm giving it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.53,1:08:45.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's very nice. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.20,1:08:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说完了吧 那就请你离去之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, why don't you make like a tree and get out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 不是离去之 是离去兮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's leave, you idiot. Make like a tree and leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.88,1:08:56.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你咬文嚼字像个大白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound like a damn fool when you say it wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.17,1:09:00.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你走! 把书也带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then, leave and take your book with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么还是没想通? 用这本书你可以发大财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get it? You could make a fortune with this book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.89,1:09:05.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:12.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加州大学落后 比数是17比16{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UCLA trails 17-16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.44,1:09:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这场比赛只剩下18秒钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 4th and 11 with only 18 seconds left of this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.86,1:09:18.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来加州大学输定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say it's all over for UCLA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.07,1:09:22.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你赌加州大学 以19比17获胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet you a million bucks UCLA wins it 19-17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:24.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是聋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, deaf, old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.16,1:09:26.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛已经结束 你输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just said it was over. You lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.57,1:09:28.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.49,1:09:29.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在踢球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes Decker with the kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.91,1:09:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up. It looks good, folks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.50,1:09:35.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很不错 踢进球门! 加州大学队 以19比17获胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks very good. Field goal! UCLA wins 19-17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.08,1:09:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的观众都疯狂了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to that Coliseum crowd go wild. Jim Decker...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.09,1:09:41.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, pops. What's the gag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:43.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道比数?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know what the score was gonna be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.42,1:09:45.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你 全在这本书里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you. It's in this book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.72,1:09:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要赌赢的那一方 就永远不会输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you gotta do is bet on the winner, and you'll never lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.85,1:09:57.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我会看一看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'll take a look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.86,1:10:01.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You damn fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.03,1:10:04.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远...永远不能把书随便放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never, never leave this book laying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道没有保险箱? 对 你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you have a safe? No, you don't have a safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.12,1:10:11.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去买个保险箱 把它锁在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a safe. Keep it locked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.04,1:10:13.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前 永远放在你身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And until then, keep it on you like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.00,1:10:15.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.12,1:10:16.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能对任何人提起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't tell anybody about it, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.04,1:10:18.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:22.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天一个孩子 或是一个疯老头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, a kid or a crazy, wild-eyed old man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.30,1:10:23.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说他自己是科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who claims to be a scientist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.92,1:10:26.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会来这里问...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to come around asking about this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.01,1:10:31.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果发生了这件事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that ever happens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.99,1:10:53.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我出不去了 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trapped. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.49,1:10:54.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, come in, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.75,1:10:56.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 情况如何? - 贝夫走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marty, what's the report? - Biff's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.12,1:10:58.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他拿到书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.33,1:11:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老人也走了 我被锁在贝夫的车房里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old man's gone, too. I'm locked in Biff's garage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.46,1:11:01.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你开迪罗里安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta fly the DeLorean over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.71,1:11:02.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来这里救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get me the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.17,1:11:04.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地址是梅森街1809号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The address is 1809 Mason Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.01,1:11:06.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白天不能开这部车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take the DeLorean out in the daylight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.01,1:11:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 我会想办法过去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but don't worry, Marty. Somehow I'll get over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.01,1:11:12.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 等一下...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, wait a minute. Doc. Hey, Doc. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.93,1:11:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真倒霉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.40,1:11:22.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 你到哪里去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff,where are you going now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.27,1:11:25.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶 不是告诉你我要去参加舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, Grandma. I'm going to the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.19,1:11:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 几点回家? - 舞会?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When you coming home? - The dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.24,1:11:29.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想回来时就会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get home when I get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.28,1:11:34.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了关车库的灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to turn off the garage light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.15,1:12:07.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty. Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.24,1:12:09.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:14.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 马丁 糟糕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, Marty. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:16.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁到哪儿去了呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is that kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.10,1:12:18.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 爸爸爱曼波 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Father loves Mambo ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.02,1:12:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 妈妈爱曼波... ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Mother loves Mambo... ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.33,1:12:25.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc. Doc, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.09,1:12:27.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.38,1:12:29.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 请说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! Marty, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.76,1:12:30.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.80,1:12:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.14,1:12:38.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.44,1:12:42.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.04,1:12:59.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.63,1:13:05.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, Doc, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.84,1:13:07.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, what happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.55,1:13:09.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么没在贝夫家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to Biff's house, and you weren't there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.17,1:13:10.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们错过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have just missed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.30,1:13:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在贝夫车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the back of Biff's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.42,1:13:13.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正在往舞会的方向前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on his way to the Enchantment Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.39,1:13:16.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能要取消这个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, listen, we may have to abort this entire plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.47,1:13:17.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting much too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.97,1:13:19.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,书就在车子的仪表板上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. The book is on Biff's dashboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.64,1:13:20.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会拿到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll grab it as soon as we get to the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.06,1:13:23.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你千万要小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you must be extremely careful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.23,1:13:24.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别撞上另一个自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to run into your other self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.69,1:13:26.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 另一个自己? - 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My other self? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.02,1:13:31.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你妈妈和你 也去参加同一个舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, your mother is at that exact same dance with you. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.24,1:13:33.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 太严重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. This could get heavy, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.49,1:13:34.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,严重 严重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy, heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.74,1:13:37.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么事 都不能让另一个自己看到你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, whatever happens, you must not let your other self see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.45,1:13:39.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则后果不堪设想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The consequences could be disastrous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.74,1:13:41.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.21,1:13:43.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是戴帽子的那位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you with the hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:44.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁 我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who, me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.00,1:13:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.42,1:13:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托把工具箱里 八分之五的板手递给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a pal and hand me a five-eighths inch wrench out of that toolbox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.26,1:13:52.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,八分之五的板手?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five-eighths?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.51,1:13:56.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是四分之三吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you mean three-quarters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.68,1:13:59.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.56,1:14:05.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你像是在做某种天气测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume you're conducting some sort of weather experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.19,1:14:10.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你怎么知道的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.36,1:14:14.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这方面有点经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I happen to have had a little experience in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.40,1:14:17.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望今晚能有闪电出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, I'm hoping to see some lightning tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.16,1:14:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管气象员说不会有雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, the weatherman says there's not gonna be any rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.28,1:14:21.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 会有很多的雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's going to be plenty of rain, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.66,1:14:23.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,风 打雷、闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wind, thunder, lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.96,1:14:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将是个很大的暴风雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be one hell of a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.75,1:14:28.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 很高兴和你聊天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks. Nice talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.63,1:14:32.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定将来会再见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we'll bump into each other some time again in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.46,1:14:35.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.17,1:15:17.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, Doc! Come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.57,1:15:39.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(海洋魅力舞会)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.84,1:15:56.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(美女图鉴)
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.17,1:16:33.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊 那个猪头卡尔文克莱在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's that punk Calvin Klein, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.04,1:16:35.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I supposed to know, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.17,1:16:36.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是他的秘书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't his secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.34,1:16:39.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去找他 他害我花了三百块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go find him. He caused 300 bucks damage to my car,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.34,1:16:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要赏他一顿饱拳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I owe him a knuckle sandwich. Get going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.97,1:16:43.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快去! 这给你 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drink up, Biff. - Yeah, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.34,1:16:44.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't you coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.43,1:16:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要看书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.23,1:17:40.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well, Mr. Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.57,1:17:43.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴看到你在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How nice to see you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.40,1:17:46.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史特兰老师 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mr. Strickland, it's nice to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.57,1:17:47.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好像闻到酒味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that liquor I smell, Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.49,1:17:49.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.08,1:17:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知酒为何物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what liquor smells like,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.41,1:17:52.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我太年轻不能喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I'm too young to drink it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.71,1:17:54.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.50,1:17:56.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:03.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,运动年鉴 有趣的主题 是家庭作业吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sports statistics, interesting subject. Homework, Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.51,1:18:06.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我又不在家里 怎么会是家庭作业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it ain't homework, 'cause I ain't at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.43,1:18:09.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的态度非常有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got a real attitude problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.64,1:18:11.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗? 走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that, Tannen? Just watch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.31,1:18:12.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because one day, I'll have you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.43,1:18:14.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好处罚你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right where I want you in detention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.98,1:18:16.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懒鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slacker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.95,1:18:30.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你还抽烟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, you smoke, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.99,1:18:33.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你讲话跟我妈一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're beginning to sound just like my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.83,1:18:35.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.33,1:18:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等我有小孩 我会让他们做他们想做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I have kids, I'm going to let them do anything they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.71,1:18:40.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.29,1:18:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真该让她写契约书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'd like to have that in writing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.96,1:18:43.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.30,1:18:46.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你干嘛这么紧张?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, why are you so nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.25,1:18:58.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(训导处)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.26,1:20:52.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:57.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.10,1:21:07.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会是"美女图鉴"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Oh Lo Lo?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.28,1:21:14.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.70,1:21:15.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 把你的脏手拿开...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.95,1:21:17.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.62,1:21:18.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.95,1:21:21.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! I'm in trouble. I blew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.54,1:21:22.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,书在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.75,1:21:23.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在贝夫那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff must still have it with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.12,1:21:25.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只拿到封页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I got is the damn cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.54,1:21:26.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where's Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:28.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你自找的 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking for it. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.96,1:21:30.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you have any idea where he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.34,1:21:32.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在可能在任何地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I mean, he could be anywhere by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.76,1:21:34.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家的未来都决定在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, the entire future depends on you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.39,1:21:36.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能拿到那本书!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}finding Biff and getting that book back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.47,1:21:37.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I just don't know where...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.89,1:21:39.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.47,1:21:42.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 他的手会断的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it, Biff. You'll break his arm. Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.06,1:21:48.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.15,1:21:51.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了 还有一个机会!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go. I got one chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.28,1:21:53.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我老爸将要揍贝夫了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old man is about to deck Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.74,1:22:01.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:16.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好像进入幻境一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about deja vu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.09,1:22:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.53,1:22:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大家让一让{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everybody, let's back up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.53,1:22:42.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,退后一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's back up. Let's everybody just back up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.75,1:22:44.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他一点空间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and give him a little bit of room, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.20,1:22:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他一点空气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little bit of air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.29,1:22:48.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 我会心肺复苏术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I know CPR. I know CPR.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.29,1:22:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.50,1:22:50.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是心肺复苏术?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's CPR?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.96,1:22:52.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.88,1:22:56.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.97,1:22:58.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是拿了他的皮夹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, did you just take his wallet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.05,1:23:00.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把那家伙的皮夹拿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just took that guy's wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.22,1:23:03.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我拿到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, success. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.72,1:23:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.64,1:23:08.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干的好 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.40,1:23:10.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把熔解器装上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as I reload the fusion generator,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.40,1:23:12.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在体育馆屋顶见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you on the roof of the high school gym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.86,1:23:14.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,屋顶见 知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the roof. 10-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.40,1:23:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 是他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.07,1:23:17.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想伪装逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, he's in disguise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.45,1:23:19.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, what's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:22.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去抓他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.13,1:23:31.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.30,1:23:32.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(1885年1月1日 目的地时间)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.72,1:23:42.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 凡间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.55,1:23:45.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 请属于我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Please be mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.97,1:23:48.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ My darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.27,1:23:51.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 永远爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Love you for all time ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.11,1:23:54.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我是傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm just a fool ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.69,1:23:59.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 爱上你的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A fool in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.12,1:24:04.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.46,1:24:12.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们再唱一首{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Let's do another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.79,1:24:15.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他到哪里去了? 不是才进来嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he go? He just came in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.55,1:24:17.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该来一首特别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that really cooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.88,1:24:20.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看! 他怎么会到台上去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! How did he get up on stage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.43,1:24:22.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等他下台就去抓他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, but when he gets down, we're gonna nail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.80,1:24:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,衣服怎么会换得这么快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did he change his clothes so fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.31,1:24:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们那边是老歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, it's an oldie where I come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.85,1:24:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一首即兴蓝调{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, listen, this is a blues riff in B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:33.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,注意我的节拍 尽量跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch me for the changes, and try and keep up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.86,1:24:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc. Doc, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.24,1:24:41.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 请说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.53,1:24:46.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫的同党追进体育馆 他们要抓我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Biff's guys chased me into the gym, and they're going to jump me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.16,1:24:47.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就快离开那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.66,1:24:49.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是另一个我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Doc, not me. The other me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.66,1:24:52.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个在舞台上演奏的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one that's up on stage playing Johnny B. Goode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.08,1:24:53.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天! 那他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott! Your other self will miss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.71,1:24:54.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会错失钟楼闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the lightning bolt at the clock tower,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.96,1:24:56.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你会回不去 这是大灾难!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you won't get back to the future, and we'll have a major paradox!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.05,1:24:59.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 什么灾难?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait. A paradox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.09,1:25:01.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是会毁灭宇宙的灾难吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean one of those things that can destroy the universe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.51,1:25:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要设法阻止那些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely. Marty, you have to stop those guys at all costs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.89,1:25:06.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时不能碰上另一个你 或是你的父母{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but without being seen by your other self or your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.93,1:25:08.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.52,1:25:16.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他到哪里去了? - 谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.11,1:25:17.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 卡尔文克莱 - 谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Calvin Klein. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.73,1:25:18.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴帽子的家伙 他在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy with the hat, where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:21.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他往那边去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. He went that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.24,1:25:24.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好像看到他拿了你的皮夹 我好像看到他拿了你的皮夹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he took your wallet. I think he took his wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.74,1:25:27.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 强尼 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Johnny, go, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.41,1:25:31.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,强尼毕谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny B. Goode{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.52,1:25:50.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.27,1:25:53.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 强尼 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Johnny, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.06,1:25:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 强尼 走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Johnny, go, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.94,1:25:59.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 强尼 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Johnny, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.86,1:26:01.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 强尼 走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Johnny, go, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.40,1:26:04.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,强尼毕谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny B. Goode{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.36,1:27:24.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们大概还没办法 接受这样的音乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you guys aren't ready for that yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.15,1:27:27.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们的小孩会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your kids are going to love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.16,1:27:38.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 成功了 没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, success. Everything's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.58,1:27:41.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在一分钟内 会降落在屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. I'll be landing at the school roof in about one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.84,1:27:43.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在那里等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.01,1:27:52.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.35,1:27:55.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 那首歌满特别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, that was very interesting music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.02,1:28:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你不介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't mind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.15,1:28:03.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治说要送我回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but George asked if he could take me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.52,1:28:06.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我就知道你们会合得来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Lorraine, I had a feeling about you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.61,1:28:08.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a feeling, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.03,1:28:10.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 笨蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, butthead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.62,1:28:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那种伪装能骗得了我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that stupid disguise would get by me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.37,1:28:19.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们来分个胜负 现在 你和我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have it out. You and me, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.42,1:28:21.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.71,1:28:25.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.88,1:28:27.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.97,1:28:29.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you chicken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.93,1:28:34.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说对了 你是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, isn't it? Nothing but a little chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.78,1:28:52.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人叫我胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody calls me chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.75,1:29:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.29,1:29:06.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然偷我东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You steal my stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.92,1:29:10.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一脚是为我车子踢的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this one's for my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.66,1:29:36.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.99,1:29:39.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! I blew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.70,1:29:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫抓到我 并把书拿走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff nailed me. He took the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.04,1:29:43.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他开车走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He drove away with it in his car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.29,1:29:45.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的错 我应该早点来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my fault, Doc. I should have got out of there sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.50,1:29:47.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了 他往哪儿去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No time for that now. Which way did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.46,1:29:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向东 朝隧道开去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}East towards the River Road Tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.63,1:29:49.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快上车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.97,1:30:02.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.64,1:30:04.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 他就在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.52,1:30:06.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,降落在他车上 把车弄瘫掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's land on him. We'll cripple his car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.56,1:30:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是迪罗里安 太轻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, he's in a '46 Ford. We're a DeLorean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.57,1:30:11.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反而会被他拆散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd rip through us like we were tin foil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.19,1:30:13.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我们该怎么做? - 我有办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So what do we do? - I have a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.28,1:30:15.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重复今晚的气象报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeating tonight's earlier weather bulletin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.45,1:30:17.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一场大雷雨 正朝山谷镇方向进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a severe thunderstorm is heading for Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.43,1:30:42.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本电台服务所有山谷郡地区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serving Hill Valley and all of Hill County,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.60,1:30:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,您现在正收听KKHV电台 山谷之声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're tuned to KKHV, the voice of Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于社区日程表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turning to community calendar,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.61,1:30:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,山谷镇妇女俱乐部蛋糕拍卖会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Hill Valley Women's Club bake sale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.49,1:30:58.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将于明天下午两点到五点举行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be held tomorrow afternoon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.87,1:31:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地点是在 森林路的社区活动中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from 2:00 to 5:00 at the community center on Forest Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.70,1:31:03.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于运动迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you sports fans out there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.04,1:31:06.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的大学足球赛真是高潮起伏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was a lot of action today in college football.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.62,1:31:08.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是前十名的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what happened to the top 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.79,1:31:12.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加州大学 以19比17胜华盛顿大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UCLA narrowly defeated Washington 19-17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.55,1:31:15.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,密歇根州大学 以42比14胜明尼苏达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michigan State crushed Minnesota 42-14.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.97,1:31:18.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,俄亥俄州大学 以20比10胜爱荷华{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohio State beat lowa 20-10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.76,1:31:20.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,密歇根大胜印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michigan blanked Indiana 30-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.30,1:31:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.47,1:31:23.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,圣母院赢北卡罗来纳 27比7{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Notre Dame over North Carolina, 27-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.27,1:31:24.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.68,1:31:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,俄克拉荷马 大胜爱荷华州大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oklahoma ripped lowa State 52-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.56,1:31:31.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,西弗吉尼亚 以26比7输给匹兹堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}West Virginia lost to Pittsburgh 26-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.73,1:31:34.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,德州农工大学 以20比10赢莱斯队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Texas A&M over Rice 20-10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.78,1:31:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马里兰 以25比12胜克雷蒙森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maryland defeated Clemson 25-12,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.45,1:31:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,德州基督大学 以47比20胜德州大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it was Texas Christian over Texas 47-20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.58,1:31:45.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重复今晚的气象报告 一场大雷雨...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeating tonight's earlier weather bulletin, a severe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.25,1:31:47.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又是你? 把那本书给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You again? Give me that book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.21,1:31:51.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:00.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离我的车远一点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.08,1:32:19.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(前方有隧道)
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.46,1:32:36.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该学到教训了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll teach him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.56,1:34:12.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 快走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.31,1:34:13.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 抓紧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.86,1:34:20.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.07,1:34:28.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活该!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.46,1:34:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,粪肥! 我恨粪肥!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manure! I hate manure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.78,1:35:08.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 一切都好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, is everything all right? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.49,1:35:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是飞行的好天气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10-4, Marty, but it's pretty miserable flying weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:12.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,降落时会遇到很多乱流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much too turbulent to make a landing from this direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.95,1:35:15.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须从南方进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to circle around and make a long approach from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.46,1:35:17.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到书了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you got the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.04,1:35:20.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到了 就在我手中!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my hand, Doc! I got it in my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.71,1:35:22.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烧掉它!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.55,1:35:23.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.67,1:35:55.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(贝夫的家)
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.17,1:35:57.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(极乐天堂)
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.84,1:36:01.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(汽车保养)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.74,1:36:10.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(乔治麦佛莱被谋杀  本地作家被枪杀致死)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.87,1:36:13.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(乔治麦佛莱的荣耀  本地作家得奖)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.35,1:36:22.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 报纸变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! That newspaper changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.40,1:36:24.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸没死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, my father's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.11,1:36:26.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那表示一切回复正常 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means everything's back to normal, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.01,1:36:29.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米布朗被判决  疯子发明家被判神精错乱)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.07,1:36:30.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米布朗接受表扬  本地发明家获奖)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.70,1:36:32.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任务完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission accomplished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.99,1:36:35.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示詹妮弗和爱因斯坦也都没事 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means Jennifer's okay and Einie's okay, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.66,1:36:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 影响已在逐渐扩大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Marty. It's the ripple effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.87,1:36:40.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来已经正常了 我们回去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future is back, so let's go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.00,1:36:43.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 赶快把我接走 好回到...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Let's get our asses back to the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.09,1:36:51.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, Doc, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.22,1:36:55.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真惊险 我几乎买了那个农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a close one, Marty. I almost bought the farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.77,1:37:02.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 别让闪电击到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, be careful. You don't want to get struck by lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.78,1:37:17.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.92,1:37:27.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.13,1:37:30.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, come in, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.51,1:37:34.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听得到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.30,1:37:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听得到吗 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you read me, Doc? Come in. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.65,1:37:52.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.45,1:38:02.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.96,1:38:06.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doc's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.48,1:38:30.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱先生!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.61,1:38:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.49,1:38:37.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字是马丁麦佛莱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your name Marty McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.00,1:38:44.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.33,1:38:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有东西要交给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.88,1:38:52.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一封信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.59,1:38:55.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一封给我的信?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A letter for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.43,1:38:58.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.68,1:39:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.97,1:39:02.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,西部联合银行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Western Union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.68,1:39:05.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们公司的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, a bunch of us at the office were kind of hoping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.18,1:39:07.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能点醒我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe you could shed some light on the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.56,1:39:12.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们持有这封信已有七十年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, we've had that envelope in our possession for the past 70 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.03,1:39:17.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上面有着非常清楚的指示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was given to us with the explicit instructions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.03,1:39:22.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要我们交给像你这样的年青人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it be delivered to a young man with your description{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.29,1:39:26.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字是马丁 就在1955年11月12日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}answering to the name of Marty at this exact location{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.91,1:39:30.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个时间、这个地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this exact minute, November 12, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.38,1:39:32.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们甚至下注赌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a little bet going as to whether{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.80,1:39:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁会不会出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this Marty would actually be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.71,1:39:36.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.38,1:39:38.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说是七十年前?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you say 70 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.93,1:39:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正确的时间是 七十年两个月又十二天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, 70 years, 2 months, 12 days to be exact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.76,1:39:43.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请在第六行签名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here sign on line 6, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.72,1:39:45.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是笔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.82,1:39:55.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(你的朋友布朗博士)
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.44,1:39:57.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是博士寄来的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from the doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.62,1:40:04.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"亲爱的马丁 如果我的计算无误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Marty, if my calculations are correct,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.58,1:40:06.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你看到迪罗里安 被闪电击中后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will receive this letter immediately after{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.25,1:40:09.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会马上看到这封信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you saw the DeLorean struck by lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.25,1:40:12.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先你放心 我活得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, let me assure you that I'm alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.29,1:40:15.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过去八个月中 我在1885年代活的很愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been living happily these past eight months in the year 1885.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.84,1:40:18.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电使我进入... 1885年!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lightning bolt...1885!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.43,1:40:20.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1885年的9月"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}September, 1885."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.76,1:40:25.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 等等 这到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, kid! Wait a minute. What's this all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.26,1:40:28.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着 博士还活着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive! The doc's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.85,1:40:31.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在老西部 但仍活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the Old West, but he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.10,1:40:32.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but, kid, you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.11,1:40:34.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,需要帮忙吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you need any help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.94,1:40:37.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个人能帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one man who can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.56,1:41:54.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 博士! 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.06,1:41:56.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 博士! 博士! - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doc! Doc! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.69,1:42:00.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 别怕 是我马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, relax, Doc. It's me. It's me! It's Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.07,1:42:03.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能! 我才把你送回未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it can't be. I just sent you back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.70,1:42:04.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No, I know. You did send me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.91,1:42:06.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我又回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to the future, but I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.95,1:42:09.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我又从未来回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.21,1:42:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.96,1:42:19.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 博士 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.21,1:42:22.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦? 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.68,1:42:30.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(未完待续)
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.10,1:42:35.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(山谷镇)
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.15,1:42:41.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.58,1:42:51.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,添南 看枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just try it, Tannen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.99,1:42:54.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来呀 小矮子 跳舞呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, runt! You can dance better than that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.51,1:43:25.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《回到未来3》
